# This directory holds the HTTP signature keypairs for ActivityPub actors.
# @semapps/crypto's keys service writes <actor-slug>/private.pem and public.pem
# at runtime. The directory must exist before the service starts.
#
# TODO Phase 1+: mount this as a persistent volume in deploy/docker-compose.yml
# so keypairs survive container restarts (otherwise every redeploy invalidates
# all signed federation requests).
